{
  "about": "Formula checks: zoo.exe's own function (run in re/lab/zoorun.py) against our engine's (the engine's 'formula' command, src/Lab.cpp) on the same inputs. The Lab runs them all after every build (Explore > Code 1:1). Each object field is [offset, type, what]: an input's name, '=<number>' for a fixed value, '-><object index>' for a pointer to another object. result: st0 (a float return), eax, or field:<object>:<offset>:<type> (what the function left there).",
